    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// A chant line, unmeasured from the first note (docs/prompts/74)." },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "//" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// `meter none;` is not the absence of a meter statement — a piece that writes" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// no `meter` is in 4/4. It is a meter whose answer to \"where do the barlines" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// fall\" is \"nowhere\", which is a real answer and the one plainchant needs." },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "//" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// Unmeasured is not the same as unmetered *time*. Every duration here is" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// exact and the performance schedules it exactly; what stops is the barline," },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// not the clock. That is the layer table again (roadmap §2): a barline is" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// notation, and notation is not the sounding." },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "//" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// This is modern notation of a chant, not chant notation: no neumes, no" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// mensural signs, and no attempt to be a facsimile." },
